line = 880
class = "wiring-gap"
severity = "high"
observed = "The occupancy finalizer invokes sandbox expiry, Rust occupancy settlement and fee-demand observation at lines 880, 888 and 896. Its kernel callers are batch-snapshot finalization at src/protocol/lxp_kernel.c:4764 and 4769. The native host executes activities and exposes no block-boundary invocation of this finalizer, and the node module/precompile path does not connect it, leaving expiry and occupancy charging inactive on that path."
